                <div class="rich-text"><html><body><p class="summary">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="summary">The page you were looking for has been moved or doesn’t exist. Please check your URL or <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="0c2e5a7f-e372-40fe-9eb0-feca44a2c7e9" data-entity-substitution="canonical" href="/search" title="Search">search our site</a>.</p>

<p>We invite you to <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="e4dee37d-cf43-4012-b5c7-d6aafae23f69" data-entity-substitution="canonical" href="/contact-us" title="Contact Us">send us a message</a>, <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="0d9bbd2e-587a-4690-8260-af43a8094f70" data-entity-substitution="canonical" media_library="Media Library" href="/news" title="News &amp; Stories">read news and stories</a>, or sign up for our emails below.</p>

<hhmi-email-signup mode="GREY" variant="DEFAULT" heading="Get the latest HHMI and program news in your inbox" baseurl="/email" textalign="CENTER" buttonlabel="Sign up for emails" buttonurl="/newsletters" socialheading="Stay connected" buttonarrow includesocial links="[{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Instagram&quot;,&quot;ariaLabel&quot;:&quot;Instagram&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/hhmi_science&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;_blank&quot;,&quot;external&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Bluesky&quot;,&quot;ariaLabel&quot;:&quot;Bluesky&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/bsky.app\/profile\/hhmi-science.bsky.social&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;_blank&quot;,&quot;external&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Linkedin&quot;,&quot;ariaLabel&quot;:&quot;Linkedin&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/howard-hughes-medical-institute&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;_blank&quot;,&quot;external&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;X&quot;,&quot;ariaLabel&quot;:&quot;X&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/x.com\/hhmi_science&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;_blank&quot;,&quot;external&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Facebook&quot;,&quot;ariaLabel&quot;:&quot;Facebook&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/HowardHughesMed&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;_blank&quot;,&quot;external&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false},{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Youtube&quot;,&quot;ariaLabel&quot;:&quot;Youtube&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/c\/HHMI&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;_blank&quot;,&quot;external&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false}]"></hhmi-email-signup>

